# everyrpg.korczak.xyz. The game's screens have addresses that are paths (owner, 23 Nov 2026):
# /settings/story, /worlds, /worlds/trash, /language, /diesel, /world/<id>, and the same under /pl/.
# The game is one static page per locale, so each of those is answered with that page by a 200
# rewrite, and the page reads the path (src/components/Rpg/settingsRoute.ts). A path the game does
# not know still gets the 404 page.

/settings                   / 200
/settings/*                 / 200
/worlds                     / 200
/worlds/*                   / 200
/language                   / 200
/diesel                     / 200
/world/*                    / 200

/pl/settings                /pl/ 200
/pl/settings/*              /pl/ 200
/pl/worlds                  /pl/ 200
/pl/worlds/*                /pl/ 200
/pl/language                /pl/ 200
/pl/diesel                  /pl/ 200
/pl/world/*                 /pl/ 200
